{"ms":3259,"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011wxhAvD2sK7xxfdwtZn1Fs","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"segments\":[{\"id\":1,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":0,\"kind\":\"heading\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"reviewed\",\"version\":1,\"sourceText\":\"Chapter I\",\"targetText\":\"1장\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":2,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":1,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"draft\",\"version\":6,\"sourceText\":\"In my younger and more vulnerable years my father gave me some advice that I've been tuming over in my mind ever since.\",\"targetText\":\"지금보다 어리고 쉽게 상처받던 시절, 아버지가 내게 해 주신 충고가 있는데 나는 그 뒤로 줄곧 그 말을 곱씹어 왔다.\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":3,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":2,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"draft\",\"version\":10,\"sourceText\":\"“Whenever you feel like criticizing any one,” he told me, “just remember that all the people in this world haven't had the advantages that you've had.”\",\"targetText\":\"“누군가를 비판하고 싶어질 때면,” 아버지는 내게 말씀하셨다. “이 세상 모든 사람이 다 너처럼 좋은 조건을 누리며 살아온 건 아니라는 걸 기억하렴.”\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":4,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":3,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"draft\",\"version\":11,\"sourceText\":\"He didn't say any more, but we've always been unusually communicative in a reserved way, and I understood that he meant a great deal more than that. In consequence, I'm inclined to reserve all judgments, a habit that has opened up many curious matures to me and also made me the victim of not a few veteran bores.\",\"targetText\":\"아버지는 더 말씀하지 않으셨지만, 우리는 늘 말수 적은 방식으로 유난히 잘 통했고, 나는 그 말에 훨씬 많은 뜻이 담겨 있음을 알았다. 그래서 나는 모든 판단을 서둘러 내리는 버릇이 생겼는데, 이 버릇 덕분에 별난 사람들이 내게 마음을 열었고, 또 지겨운 사람들의 희생양이 되기도 했다.\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[{\"id\":1,\"parentId\":null,\"side\":\"source\",\"author\":\"translator\",\"body\":\"앞 문장의 reserved와 말장난? 둘을 같은 말로 받을지 고민\",\"resolved\":false,\"quote\":\"reserve all judgments\"}],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":5,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":4,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"untranslated\",\"version\":9,\"sourceText\":\"The abnormal rnind is quick to detect and attach itself to this quality when it appears in a normal person, and so it came about that in college I was unjust1y accused of being a politician, because I was privy to the secret griefs of wild, unknown men.\",\"targetText\":\"\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]}]}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"022f73a3-1333-4021-b756-d9db4ee509c9","uuid":"bc258a24-9491-498a-9135-b24ed4380abb","timestamp":"2026-10-18T11:21:36.960Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"segments\":[{\"id\":1,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":0,\"kind\":\"heading\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"reviewed\",\"version\":1,\"sourceText\":\"Chapter I\",\"targetText\":\"1장\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":2,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":1,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"draft\",\"version\":6,\"sourceText\":\"In my younger and more vulnerable years my father gave me some advice that I've been tuming over in my mind ever since.\",\"targetText\":\"지금보다 어리고 쉽게 상처받던 시절, 아버지가 내게 해 주신 충고가 있는데 나는 그 뒤로 줄곧 그 말을 곱씹어 왔다.\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":3,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":2,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"draft\",\"version\":10,\"sourceText\":\"“Whenever you feel like criticizing any one,” he told me, “just remember that all the people in this world haven't had the advantages that you've had.”\",\"targetText\":\"“누군가를 비판하고 싶어질 때면,” 아버지는 내게 말씀하셨다. “이 세상 모든 사람이 다 너처럼 좋은 조건을 누리며 살아온 건 아니라는 걸 기억하렴.”\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":4,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":3,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"draft\",\"version\":11,\"sourceText\":\"He didn't say any more, but we've always been unusually communicative in a reserved way, and I understood that he meant a great deal more than that. In consequence, I'm inclined to reserve all judgments, a habit that has opened up many curious matures to me and also made me the victim of not a few veteran bores.\",\"targetText\":\"아버지는 더 말씀하지 않으셨지만, 우리는 늘 말수 적은 방식으로 유난히 잘 통했고, 나는 그 말에 훨씬 많은 뜻이 담겨 있음을 알았다. 그래서 나는 모든 판단을 서둘러 내리는 버릇이 생겼는데, 이 버릇 덕분에 별난 사람들이 내게 마음을 열었고, 또 지겨운 사람들의 희생양이 되기도 했다.\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[{\"id\":1,\"parentId\":null,\"side\":\"source\",\"author\":\"translator\",\"body\":\"앞 문장의 reserved와 말장난? 둘을 같은 말로 받을지 고민\",\"resolved\":false,\"quote\":\"reserve all judgments\"}],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":5,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":4,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"untranslated\",\"version\":9,\"sourceText\":\"The abnormal rnind is quick to detect and attach itself to this quality when it appears in a normal person, and so it came about that in college I was unjust1y accused of being a politician, because I was privy to the secret griefs of wild, unknown men.\",\"targetText\":\"\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]}]}","structuredContent":{"segments":[{"id":1,"chapterId":1,"idx":0,"kind":"heading","pageStart":1,"pageEnd":1,"status":"reviewed","version":1,"sourceText":"Chapter I","targetText":"1장","notes":[],"comments":[],"terms":[]},{"id":2,"chapterId":1,"idx":1,"kind":"paragraph","pageStart":1,"pageEnd":1,"status":"draft","version":6,"sourceText":"In my younger and more vulnerable years my father gave me some advice that I've been tuming over in my mind ever since.","targetText":"지금보다 어리고 쉽게 상처받던 시절, 아버지가 내게 해 주신 충고가 있는데 나는 그 뒤로 줄곧 그 말을 곱씹어 왔다.","notes":[],"comments":[],"terms":[]},{"id":3,"chapterId":1,"idx":2,"kind":"paragraph","pageStart":1,"pageEnd":1,"status":"draft","version":10,"sourceText":"“Whenever you feel like criticizing any one,” he told me, “just remember that all the people in this world haven't had the advantages that you've had.”","targetText":"“누군가를 